1
00:00:02,008 --> 00:00:04,388
Book seven is Persepolis Rising.

2
00:00:04,408 --> 00:00:06,413
Nearly thirty years have passed.

3
00:00:06,433 --> 00:00:07,638
The Transport Union,

4
00:00:07,658 --> 00:00:09,178
led by Camina Drummer,

5
00:00:09,198 --> 00:00:10,653
runs the gates.

6
00:00:10,673 --> 00:00:12,753
Holden and Naomi are getting ready to

7
00:00:12,773 --> 00:00:15,853
retire and hand the Rocinante to Bobbie.

8
00:00:15,873 --> 00:00:17,953
Then the hidden world of Laconia comes

9
00:00:17,973 --> 00:00:19,278
out of the dark.

10
00:00:19,298 --> 00:00:21,928
Three stories: the fall of Medina,

11
00:00:21,948 --> 00:00:25,253
Drummer's surrender, and the Rocinante underground.

12
00:00:25,273 --> 00:00:26,577
Spoilers ahead!

13
00:00:27,341 --> 00:00:29,221
Story one: Medina.

14
00:00:29,241 --> 00:00:31,171
Without warning, a ship comes through the

15
00:00:31,191 --> 00:00:32,621
Laconia gate.

16
00:00:32,641 --> 00:00:34,771
It is the Heart of the Tempest,

17
00:00:34,791 --> 00:00:37,646
a battleship built by alien machines.

18
00:00:37,666 --> 00:00:40,671
Its magnetic weapon tears Medina's rail guns

19
00:00:40,691 --> 00:00:42,771
apart from far away.

20
00:00:42,791 --> 00:00:45,196
The station that controls the Ring falls

21
00:00:45,216 --> 00:00:47,681
in hours, without a real fight.

22
00:00:48,292 --> 00:00:51,197
Duarte names Santiago Singh as the governor

23
00:00:51,217 --> 00:00:52,467
of Medina.

24
00:00:52,492 --> 00:00:54,847
Singh is a young Laconian officer who

25
00:00:54,867 --> 00:00:56,242
believes in order,

26
00:00:56,262 --> 00:00:58,337
and he wants to rule fairly.

27
00:00:58,402 --> 00:01:00,357
But when a bomb nearly kills him,

28
00:01:00,377 --> 00:01:01,932
he turns hard.

29
00:01:01,952 --> 00:01:05,867
Curfews, censorship, and public prisons follow.

30
00:01:05,922 --> 00:01:08,202
Every rule makes the people of Medina

31
00:01:08,222 --> 00:01:09,809
hate Laconia more.

32
00:01:10,556 --> 00:01:11,986
Singh hunts the underground,

33
00:01:12,006 --> 00:01:14,286
and he catches its most famous member:

34
00:01:14,306 --> 00:01:15,761
James Holden.

35
00:01:15,781 --> 00:01:18,636
Duarte orders Holden sent to Laconia as

36
00:01:18,656 --> 00:01:19,706
a prisoner.

37
00:01:19,871 --> 00:01:21,426
Singh hopes it will prove he can

38
00:01:21,446 --> 00:01:23,626
keep Medina under control.

39
00:01:23,646 --> 00:01:24,746
It doesn't.

40
00:01:24,846 --> 00:01:26,026
And in Laconia,

41
00:01:26,046 --> 00:01:27,656
failure has a price.

42
00:01:28,416 --> 00:01:30,571
Story two: Camina Drummer,

43
00:01:30,591 --> 00:01:32,991
president of the Transport Union.

44
00:01:33,046 --> 00:01:34,976
The Tempest goes through the Ring into

45
00:01:34,996 --> 00:01:36,476
the solar system.

46
00:01:36,496 --> 00:01:39,256
Earth, Mars, and the Union send everything

47
00:01:39,276 --> 00:01:40,726
they have against it.

48
00:01:40,751 --> 00:01:43,606
Even nuclear weapons barely scratch it.

49
00:01:43,626 --> 00:01:45,756
The combined fleet is wiped out.

50
00:01:46,389 --> 00:01:47,644
To save lives,

51
00:01:47,664 --> 00:01:50,929
Drummer surrenders, and Earth and Mars follow.

52
00:01:50,949 --> 00:01:53,129
Laconia lets her keep her job,

53
00:01:53,149 --> 00:01:54,704
so long as she does what she's

54
00:01:54,724 --> 00:01:55,629
told.

55
00:01:55,649 --> 00:01:57,979
Her husband Saba is still free,

56
00:01:57,999 --> 00:02:00,704
and he leads the resistance on Medina.

57
00:02:00,724 --> 00:02:02,804
Drummer has to smile for the cameras

58
00:02:02,824 --> 00:02:04,976
while secretly hoping he wins.

59
00:02:05,715 --> 00:02:08,295
Story three: the Rocinante.

60
00:02:08,315 --> 00:02:10,045
The crew is trapped on Medina when

61
00:02:10,065 --> 00:02:13,240
it falls, so they join Saba's resistance.

62
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:15,565
They plan a raid to steal Laconian

63
00:02:15,585 --> 00:02:18,855
codes, using a staged bombing as cover.

64
00:02:18,910 --> 00:02:19,915
The raid works,

65
00:02:19,935 --> 00:02:21,815
but Holden is captured.

66
00:02:21,835 --> 00:02:24,140
Now the resistance has one goal:

67
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:25,640
get as many ships out through the

68
00:02:25,660 --> 00:02:27,105
gates as they can.

69
00:02:27,761 --> 00:02:29,616
The breakout begins.

70
00:02:29,636 --> 00:02:31,991
Bobbie and her team capture a Laconian

71
00:02:32,011 --> 00:02:34,541
warship, the Gathering Storm.

72
00:02:34,561 --> 00:02:36,566
Clarissa uses the last of her old

73
00:02:36,586 --> 00:02:39,291
body modifications to stop an ambush,

74
00:02:39,311 --> 00:02:40,766
and it kills her.

75
00:02:40,786 --> 00:02:43,366
The Rocinante and a small fleet escape

76
00:02:43,386 --> 00:02:45,166
through the gates to a remote world

77
00:02:45,186 --> 00:02:48,528
called Freehold, and the resistance lives on.

78
00:02:49,187 --> 00:02:51,642
Book seven ends on Laconia.

79
00:02:51,662 --> 00:02:54,787
Singh is executed on Duarte's orders.

80
00:02:54,912 --> 00:02:56,992
Holden meets Duarte himself,

81
00:02:57,012 --> 00:02:59,342
who plans to use the protomolecule to

82
00:02:59,362 --> 00:03:01,462
rule humanity forever.

83
00:03:01,637 --> 00:03:03,817
Holden warns him about whatever killed the

84
00:03:03,837 --> 00:03:06,927
gate builders, but Duarte isn't listening.

85
00:03:06,947 --> 00:03:08,677
Next up: book eight,

86
00:03:08,697 --> 00:03:10,072
Tiamat's Wrath.

